        }
       },
       "langs": [
        "en"
       ],
       "text": "AI agents in the OS, capturing sensitive data from apps like Signal, present an existential threat to privacy \n\nSadly, OS vendors are integrating agents recklessly, w/o giving Signal and other apps good ways to block AI data access and protect you \n\nSo, we're doing what we can w/ the tools we have👇"
      },
