      }
     },
     "langs": [
      "en"
     ],
     "text": "One year ago, the President of Signal warned AI agents could “lead to an elimination of privacy and security” for software.\n\nSystemic issues (cyber threats, financial crises) have flare gun-bright warning signs (privacy intrusion, predatory lending) identified early by experts. \n\nWe should listen!"
    },
